<title>USA: Biogen Inc drug even with competitor.</title>
<headline>Biogen Inc drug even with competitor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avonex, the multiple-sclerosis drug by Biogen Inc, has caught up with or overtaken a competing drug marketed by its much-larger rival Schering AG after only seven months on the market, The Wall Street Journal reported Thursday.</p>
<p>Sales of Avonex accounted for 53 percent of the U.S. market during Thanksgiving week, compared with 47 percent for Schering's Betaseron, the story said.</p>
